ésentation intelligible et partagée d’écosystèmes complexes (métier, technique, réglementaire) via ontologies, modèles visuels, IA explicable.\nExemple Honda : Capacité à concevoir des moteurs s’appliquant à motos, voitures, groupes électrogènes → ici : capacité à “modéliser n’importe quel domaine”.\n","expandcollapseRenderedStartX":412.43448264387507,"expandcollapseRenderedStartY":122.14955218158025,"expandcollapseRenderedCueSize":12,"size-before-collapse":{"w":242,"h":170},"collapsedChildren":null,"x-before-fisheye":95.4719137537545,"y-before-fisheye":230.778021112322,"width-before-fisheye":242,"height-before-fisheye":170},"position":{"x":205.5769043093859,"y":-5058.564678226987},"group":"nodes","removed":false,"selected":false,"selectable":true,"locked":false,"grabbable":true,"pannable":false,"classes":""},{"data":{"id":"d550f739-2c34-4f91-b2a4-45258b044529","timestamp":"2025-06-22T13:42:06.973Z","type":"resource","label":"Resources","position":{"x":100,"y":100},"parent":"1238d460-c9ea-4910-a8c4-b7e48a767e30","description":null},"position":{"x":2475.0114984327247,"y":-4023.769190606466},"group":"nodes","removed":false,"selected":false,"selectable":true,"locked":false,"grabbable":true,"pannable":false,"classes":""},{"data":{"id":"c18b9333-4240-461e-85fb-2277ccb9a2e7","timestamp":"2025-06-22T13:42:23.340Z","type":"value-stream","label":"Value Stream","position":{"x":100,"y":100},"parent":"1238d460-c9ea-4910-a8c4-b7e48a767e30","description":null},"position":{"x":2384.0114984327247,"y":-4023.769190606466},"group":"nodes","removed":false,"selected":false,"selectable":true,"locked":false,"grabbable":true,"pannable":false,"classes":""},{"data":{"id":"16819b41-da08-4fbf-ba16-6de138f7f2a5","expandcollapseRenderedStartX":30.19194727277332,"expandcollapseRenderedStartY":78.80886555427082,"expandcollapseRenderedCueSize":12,"label":"Compétences Centrales","type":"grouping","x-before-fisheye":1034.2925049973478,"y-before-fisheye":-2732.552198237254,"width-before-fisheye":2794.5850099946956,"height-before-fisheye":5895.104396474508},"position":{"x":496.5552842824619,"y":-4580.9797969586325},"group":"nodes","removed":false,"selected":false,"selectable":true,"locked":false,"grabbable":true,"pannable":false,"classes":""},{"data":{"id":"ee57f9a9-7174-460e-a81a-87b456e87c06","timestamp":"2025-06-22T15:58:41.720Z","type":"capability","label":"2 : Gouvernance de la donnée distribuée et souveraine","position":{"x":100,"y":100},"parent":"16819b41-da08-4fbf-ba16-6de138f7f2a5","description":"Acteurs clés : Alexandre Vial, Tarik Rida, Yann de Cambourg\nFonction : Structurer la donnée dans des architectures distribuées, interopérables, gouvernées, avec maîtrise du cadre juridique et technique (ex : FHIR, Data Mesh, ERP).\nExemple Honda : Intégration parfaite entre design, moteur, chaîne logistique → ici : continuité entre système d'information et usages métier.","expandcollapseRenderedStartX":766.4225586654175,"expandcollapseRenderedStartY":48.4562987547024,"expandcollapseRenderedCueSize":12,"size-before-collapse":{"w":242,"h":170},"collapsedChildren":null,"x-before-fisheye":90,"y-before-fisheye":27.5,"width-before-fisheye":242,"height-before-fisheye":170},"position":{"x":782.488977984413,"y":-4337.227295589789},"group":"nodes","removed":false,"selected":false,"selectable":true,"locked":false,"grabbable":true,"pannable":false,"classes":""},{"data":{"id":"766f919a-c9f6-4885-b62b-55ba7bcf461f","timestamp":"2025-06-22T15:59:09.601Z","type":"capability","label":"3 : Opérationnalisation augmentée par l’IA","position":{"x":100,"y":100},"parent":"16819b41-da08-4fbf-ba16-6de138f7f2a5","description":"Acteurs clés : Sébastien Moffront, Vincent Henry, Sylvain (Boldo)\nFonction : Transformer des connaissances dispersées (documents, processus, données) en copilotes, interfaces intelligentes, dashboards pilotables.\nExemple Honda : Processus industrialisés réplicables sur différents produits → ici : pipeline de capitalisation + activation par IA.\n","expandcollapse